    "sections": {
        "description": "The Automotive Parts Theme is a sleek, responsive, and modern website template tailored for businesses dealing with automotive parts, car accessories, auto spare parts, aftermarket upgrades, OEM replacements, and vehicle maintenance services. Designed with both aesthetics and functionality in mind, this theme is ideal for showcasing a wide range of auto parts—from engine parts, brake pads, car batteries, suspension systems, and exhaust parts to headlights, radiators, AC compressors, spark plugs, car mirrors, tires, alloy wheels, diagnostic devices, and garage tools. Perfect for auto parts retailers, detailing shops, car restoration services, automotive service centers, car repair shops, spare parts resellers, auto workshops, auto dealerships, auto repair garages, and online automotive stores, this theme also works seamlessly for motorcycle parts, truck accessories, bicycle parts, car audio systems, and off-road vehicle accessories, providing a powerful digital storefront to boost sales. Built on a secure and clean codebase with Bootstrap, it is fully responsive, mobile-friendly, retina-ready, and optimized for SEO, ensuring your site looks stunning and loads fast across all devices. Its elegant, minimal layout highlights product categories, repair services, and special offers with customizable banners, featured product sections, and call-to-action (CTA) buttons. A testimonial section, team profiles, blog layouts, and integrated social media features help improve customer engagement and trust. This theme is translation-ready, supports schema markup, and includes advanced customization options for fonts, colors, and layouts. Compatible with WooCommerce for inventory management, product listings, and checkout pages, and best paired with the Advanced Product Search plugin for smart filtering, real-time product search, and improved user experience, this multipurpose automotive-friendly theme is perfect for building a professional, scalable, and sales-driven online auto parts store."
    },
